# Internal research. Not published, for two reasons:
#
#   * `repos/` holds cloned third-party sources. Large, and not ours to
#     redistribute -- one of them carries NO licence at all, which makes
#     redistributing it a copyright question rather than a size one.
#   * The notes and licence matrix name two projects that carry an unreported,
#     exploitable flaw. Publishing them would be an uncoordinated disclosure
#     against software whose maintainers we have not contacted. The finding is
#     published in FINDINGS.md §2 without the names; the names are held here.
#
# THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md stands on its own: no third-party code is copied into
# this codebase, and every dependency is consumed as a package under its own
# licence. Nothing in the public tree depends on this directory.
.research/

# Python
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.hypothesis/

# Secrets and local state. Never commit any of these.
.env
*.key
*.pem
vault-data/
audit-*.jsonl
dist/
*.cdx.json
evals-report.json
